    "updated_at": "2019-04-30T12:59:34Z",
    "body": "We went over this during the Web Components F2F and as I recalled we had pretty explicitly decided on the current model I looked into that and it turns out user agents do create style sheets today. They might not fetch subresources and they might not contribute to resolved styles, but `<style>.sheet` is non-null.",
